ails","notes":"Visit in daylight, stay on marked paths and bring water; use the short trail system to compare the preserve’s three ecosystems.","short_summary":"Experience a compact Everglades-focused outdoor classroom on the west side of MMC.","evidence_claim":"FIU describes the Nature Preserve as an 11-acre environmental education facility with three ecosystems, guided nature trails and a 0.6-mile jogging path.","source_url":"https://ignite.fiu.edu/give-now/giving-opportunities/units-and-divisions/university-sustainability/nature-preserve/index.html","source_title":"Nature Preserve | FIU Foundation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"FIU states that the preserve is open to the public daily from sunrise to sunset; use daylight hours and designated paths.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fiu-first-weekend-07-frost-art-museum","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Patricia & Phillip Frost Art Museum","title":"Saturday: Browse the Frost Art Museum","subtitle":"See current exhibitions without an admission charge","notes":"Check the exhibitions page before arrival, enter during museum hours and leave time to view the three-story atrium and gallery spaces.","short_summary":"Make the campus art museum the structured cultural stop of the weekend.","evidence_claim":"The Frost Art Museum states that admission is always free and open to the public during normal museum hours.","source_url":"https://frost.fiu.edu/visit/index.html","source_title":"Visitor Information | Patricia & Phillip Frost Art Museum","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open Tuesday–Sunday, 11 a.m.–5 p.m.; closed Mondays and most legal and university holidays. Visitor parking requires payment.","cost_status":"free","und